1
00:05:21,176 --> 00:05:27,176
His past was taken. His vengeance is fueled.

2
00:10:42,352 --> 00:10:48,352
The Stranger is a action, thriller, mystery film directed by Rob Lieberman.

3
00:16:03,529 --> 00:16:09,529
The Stranger is a man with no name, no memory and
absolutely nothing left to lose.

4
00:21:24,705 --> 00:21:30,705
But when he finds himself hunted by both the FBI and the
Russian mob, this amnesiac decides to fight back.

5
00:26:45,882 --> 00:26:51,882
Pursuit cannot stop him.

6
00:32:07,058 --> 00:32:13,058
Torture will not break him.

7
00:37:28,235 --> 00:37:34,235
And with every beating, bullet and betrayal, he’ll remember another piece of the
horror that took away his career, his family and his identity.

8
00:42:49,411 --> 00:42:55,411
The Stranger, played by Steve Austin.

9
00:48:10,588 --> 00:48:16,588
Grace Bishop, played by Erica Cerra.

10
00:53:31,764 --> 00:53:37,764
Stranger's Daughter, played by Calista Bashuk.

11
00:58:52,941 --> 00:58:58,941
Stranger's Wife, played by Karly Warkentin.

12
01:04:14,117 --> 01:04:20,117
Grandaughter Katya, played by Dalila Bela.

13
01:09:35,294 --> 01:09:41,294
Mason Reese, played by Adam Beach.

14
01:14:56,470 --> 01:15:02,470
The Stranger is a 2010 Canadian-American action film written by Quinn Scott, directed
by Robert Lieberman, and starring former WWE wrestler Steve Austin.

15
01:20:17,647 --> 01:20:23,647
The film was released on direct-to-DVD and Blu-ray in
the United States on June 1, 2010.

16
01:25:38,823 --> 01:25:44,823
The tone is mind_bending and intense.
